WEBVTT

00:00:28.107 --> 00:00:31.152
My hometown is the South Bronx
in New York City,

00:00:31.152 --> 00:00:32.153
(Cheers)

00:00:32.195 --> 00:00:33.362
holla --

00:00:33.362 --> 00:00:35.114
(Applause)

00:00:35.156 --> 00:00:37.241
And it’s the kind of neighborhood

00:00:37.283 --> 00:00:42.413
that, some might say,
actually has a talent repulsion strategy.

00:00:44.248 --> 00:00:45.792
Back in the 1980s,

00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:48.795
I walked by this crack house
on the way to the subway

00:00:48.836 --> 00:00:52.090
that would take me to my high school,
one of the best in the country,

00:00:52.131 --> 00:00:53.758
the Bronx High School of Science.

00:00:53.758 --> 00:00:56.469
Alright, figured there'd be at least
some of you in here.

00:00:56.469 --> 00:01:00.640
Neighborhoods like mine are places
where inequality is assumed